l studios or anything in the  mcu but as i mentioned his tweet which  we're about to go over has been  retweeted by some big insiders so here  is the tweet and list of names that he  said is joining marvel studios his tweet  says i'm reliably informed that marvel  studios have signed epic talent for  phase 5. here's the list john boyega  henry cavill jody comer daisy edgar  jones john krasinski goncarlo esposito  and denzel washington now the tweet ends  by saying to be announced with some on  stage by kevin feige at d23 expo 2022  fantastic four she-hulk x-men he had a  follow-up tweet that said bring on d23  expo 2022 now these are obviously huge  names and of course we're going to be  talking about the roles that they could  possibly be playing but first let's talk  about credibility now i don't know  anything about emmett kennedy he seems  to be respectable in his own industry  and of course it's always possible that  you can meet other people who know  information that could be legitimate  having said that take this with a grain  of salt because he's not in our industry  however like i said some big insiders  like daniel rpk have retweeted the list  that he has put out there giving him  credit for it daniel rpk is known for  his leaks and he's been very accurate  very lately also geek vibes nation  recently put out that same list also  giving credit to emmett and skyler  schuler over at the dis insider who i  know is very careful about what he says  online says that daisy edgar jones as  sue storm wouldn't that be fantastic  with a little smirk face so it seems  like this list or at least some people  on this list could be legitimately cast  for some roles in the x-men and the  fantastic four and marvel studios now i  also want to add that john boyega of  course is from the star wars franchise  grace randolph recently said that marvel  studios was looking at somebody from the  star wars franchise so this also goes  with that report as well now who could  these 