 again kind of like a  superman and since superman is played by  henry cavill in the dc universe i think  we know that henry cavill would make a  good century or hyperion in the mcu now  the controversial thing about that is  that he would simply be switching from  dc to marvel almost playing the same  role and it would kind of be a marvel vs  dc thing but hey i'm all for him joining  the mcu and the last one is john  krasinski now this is controversial  because it seemingly appeared that john  krasinski was only cast as mr fantastic  strictly for multiverse of madness and  not the main mcu mr fantastic kevin  feige had already stated that it was  sort of a fan service to cast john  krasinski in multiverse of madness so we  didn't think that he would be the main  one however he is on this list so it  looks like he could indeed still be  playing the main mr fantastic unless  they cast him for another role which  would be very interesting but i would be  very curious to see who he played  however i would love him to play mr  fantastic so let me know what you think  about all of these actors in this report  and who you think they'll be playing  leave your comments down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you don't miss out on any of the  latest news for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

